# @headless
# Fresh NEWWORLD, 08:00. Use gothic-body-runner --game-parity --step-ms 8.
# Start at the harbour mouth, facing open water. Return through the upper quarter and barracks to the market.
# NPC CPU windows are steady..return, return..arrived, and arrived..end.
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_SHIP_01
watch player
cam at -1385 42 3172 -2500 42 4176
mark warm
wait 6000
mark steady
wait 8000
mark return
cam follow 500 220 180
route 500 NW_CITY_HABOUR_SHIP_01 NW_CITY_UPTOWN_PATH_11 NW_CITY_HABOUR_KASERN_18 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_17
mark arrived
wait 4000
mark end
